 kit welcome - walks a newcomer through what kit needs, the toolchains, setup, and the workflow

   one of
   *kit welcome*  walks a newcomer through what kit needs, the toolchains, setup, and the workflow

     --text     prints the guide, even on a terminal

   --checks     prints the checks alone, one line each
   --fix        runs one check's fix, then checks again
   --keep       keeps a terminal's finding as it is: it holds from now on, in the profile it was
                judged in; then says the check as it now is
   --unkeep     undoes a keep, so the finding is judged again, and says it


 kit welcome
